2 TITL Nancy Kemp Last Will and Testament naming children as heirs,part 1of 2
3 CONT Nancy (Wallis) Kemp Last Will and Testament detailing her sons and daughters names and her father, James Wallis
3 CONT 
3 CONT In the name of God Amen I Nancy Kemp   of the County of Iredell and State of North Carolina being very sick & weak in body but in perfect mind and memory than the be given unto God calling unto mind the mortality of my Body and knowing that it is a
3 CONC ppointed for all mankind once to die do make this my last will and Testament ( that is to say ) as touching such worldly estate wherewith it hath pleased God to bless me with in this life I give demise and dispose of the same in the manner followin
3 CONC g manner and from first I give to my son Isaac Kemp the sum of one dollar out of estate also to my son John Kemp I give one dollar likewise to Evan Kemp my son bequeath one dollar , Also to Squire Kemp my son I leave one white Ewe called the bell y
3 CONC ew , one ram & a young ewe to my daughter Polly Norman, I give one dollar , to my daughter Martha Johnston I give one dollar , to my daughter Nancy Marlow   I give one dollar , To my daughter Rebkah Brown , I give one dollar , To my daughter Pruden
3 CONC ce Kemp I leave one feather bead & furniture & bead Stead & a low turnd B Stead, one Pot & Pot Hooks & Iron trammel likewise one dresser the funiture of S Dresser I wish to be eaqually divided between my daughters Nelly , Sarah & Prudence Kemp, t
3 CONC o my Daughter Sarah Kemp I give one duffle Blanket one checkd Sheet , all the ?thers in a certain Bag , which I have & all my Ducks & also one beed cover which is to be quilted , likewise one walnut table , a shovel plough , To my daughter Prudenc
3 CONC e I give one shovel plough , one pair Iron traces & hammer chain & two sickles , the Middle & two sives & meal Sifter I give to daughter Sarah & Prudence Kemp , ( aqually ) To my daughter ▒ iah Kemp I give one pot & hooks & Iron Trammel also on
3 CONC e brown ▒ a Sycarling , sons furniture as Chares Chares , Pails Crocks & C. I give to my daughter Sarah & Prudence , Hemp , , eaqually . one sixteen Dollar note.
3 CONT Forty dollar notes on Squire Kemp , one Ten dollar note on John  Carlow , & one Five Dollar note on Charles Hooper, I give to my daugor Nelly , Sarah & Prudence Kemp Eaqually , after my Debts are charged out of  the same one Feather Bed , & one bi
3 CONC g oven , I give to my daughter Nelly Kemp , Likewise one brindle cow , one little , sow & one called the quinea sow , One half the Corn & fodder on my planta? daughter Sarah and Prudence Kemp eaqually , the 5th other half I grosson I give to my age
3 CONC d Father Jas Wallis , to my son Mathew Kemp one red bed quilt one striped blanket , one sheet , one pillow one rope traces & Hames & one small oven , to my daughter Sarah Kemp  one Skillet Two dollars which my son Squire Kemp , one me I give my dau
3 CONC ghter Nelly , Sarah  & prudence Kemp , eaqually to my daughter Sarah Kemp I give one cotton Wheel & one Check reel my daughter Prudence Kemp I give one Beehive , & one pare fire  To Sarah one Lamp . I also constitute make & ordain John Smithson th
3 CONC e sole executor of this my last will & testament & hereby utterly disalow revoke & disavow all & every former
