0 @N652@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Corruption of these people and their data is sad. Lattingtown, Oysterbay Township, (near Glen Cove), Queens county, NY is an entirely different place than Lattintown in Ulster, NY that is 100 mies away. Did they move? No explanation has been made f
