0 @N737@ NOTE Although FindAGrave says she was born in Wright, Raleigh Co., West Virginia (for which there is no evidence), West Virginia did not become a state until 1863. In 1742, the area that is now Raleigh County would have been in the very large Aug
1 CONC usta  County. The present day unincorporated "town" (which it is not) most likely did not exist.
