0 @N787@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Richard EDGE was probably born about 1703 in Tipton, Staffordshire. His father, Timothy, was 28 and his mother, Ann was 25. Her maiden name not given in his baptism record and hasn't been verified. 
1 CONT He married Sarah WARRAM on 3 June 1723 in Tipton. 
1 CONT They had at least seven sons in 19 years. 
1 CONT He died four months after his wife died. Richard died in April 1755 in Tipton, Staffordshire, at the age of 52, and was buried on 11th of April in St. Martin's courtyard.
