1 CONT Doctor Benjamin Ware, d. July 16, 1744 in the 57th year of his age.  
1 CONT 
1 CONT 10/02/13 update below credited to Kevin Avery (#47024642):  
1 CONT 
1 CONT Son of John Ware and his second wife, Joanna (Gay) Whiting Ware.  
1 CONT 
1 CONT He married, first, on May 21,1730 at Stoughton,MA, Zabiah Billings.  She was born on Oct 22,1711, a daughter of Ebenezer and Jerusha Billings of Stoughton.  She died at Wrentham,MA on Dec 1,1738.
1 CONT 
1 CONT He married, second, on May 14,1741 at Wrentham,MA, Melatiah (Fisher) Ware, widow of Jonathan Ware.  She was born at Wrentham,MA on Oct 6,1705, a daughter of Ebenezer Fisher and Abigail (Ellis) Fisher.  
1 CONT Her third husband, married in 1745, was Ephraim Leonard.  
1 CONT 
1 CONT ~  https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/66201363/benjamin-ware
