0 @N904@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Hannah Ketland was born in 1738 in Walsall, Staffordshire, England. 
1 CONT She married Timothy Edge on September 23, 1760, in Wolverhampton, Staffordshire. 
1 CONT They had ten children in 18 years. Hannah died and was buried in Bloxwich in March 1780, probably from complications of childbirth. She was 42 years old and left Timothy with six children under the age of 10.
